Build ccv and NNC into one shared library

Adds cc_shared_library ccv_nnc_shared, rooted at @ccv's nnc and ccv targets
and @sqlite3's implementation, with soname libccv_nnc.so, plus a cc_import
and a ccv_nnc_dynamic interface over it. The four shims C_ccv, C_nnc,
C_sqlite3 and C_sfmt now point at it, so a consumer links one copy of the
CUDA fatbin and the ccv host code instead of one per binary. sqlite is
included because Store.swift opens handles that ccv_nnc_tensor_read
consumes, and both must use the same sqlite.

cc_shared_library only whole-archives its direct dependencies. The
transitive sub-libraries are retained by alwayslink in @ccv.
